WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.698 --> 00:00:04.167
I like hearing ravens around when I’m
hunting.

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:07.503
Let’s me know that the game is out there.

00:00:18.548 --> 00:00:20.183
That’s how you pray to the raven.

00:00:20.183 --> 00:00:22.452
Great, great grandma Alda taught me.

00:00:22.452 --> 00:00:25.221
“Grandma, I have bad luck,
I can’t get moose.” 

00:00:25.221 --> 00:00:26.889
She told me, “Pray to the raven then.” 

00:00:27.624 --> 00:00:29.425
And so I prayed to the raven,

00:00:29.425 --> 00:00:30.627
I got a moose after that.

00:00:39.335 --> 00:00:41.437
I feel really good about my girls future.

00:00:41.437 --> 00:00:42.739
Ten, fifteen years from now,

00:00:42.739 --> 00:00:45.308
they're going to have their own families
and they're going to be

00:00:45.308 --> 00:00:48.678
bringing their kids out and showing them
different lands, landmarks,

00:00:49.245 --> 00:00:51.114
hills, and creeks.

00:02:49.899 --> 00:02:52.902
Trying, I’m trying, I’m trying to get this bull to walk
towards us.

00:02:56.973 --> 00:03:00.676
It's not an everyday opportunity
out here to shoot a moose.

00:03:01.477 --> 00:03:04.113
It'll feed a lot of people.

00:03:05.581 --> 00:03:07.817
Most of times
when I call out moose like this,

00:03:08.351 --> 00:03:10.186
they'll come directly to the call.

00:03:10.186 --> 00:03:11.854
So, I'm not sure if he seen us.

00:03:11.854 --> 00:03:14.090
Maybe he spotted us up here
on this little hill. It was

00:03:23.566 --> 00:03:27.170
He must keep his cow in that back
lake back there.

00:03:28.437 --> 00:03:30.540
He’s just pushing us away maybe.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:31.874
Don’t even want to fight.

00:03:33.776 --> 00:03:36.612
Yeah, ‘cause he’s
coming in close but doesn’t want to fight.

00:03:36.946 --> 00:03:38.981
Just like he’s protecting his cow.

00:03:40.817 --> 00:03:44.320
You definitely need a lot of patience
to be successful in this country.

00:03:45.555 --> 00:03:46.956
You think we should come back to this
lake?

00:03:46.956 --> 00:03:48.057
Yeah.

00:03:48.658 --> 00:03:50.092
Seems pretty promising.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.228
Oh, yeah.

